Z||000000||Rare87GT||12-20-2001||08:35 PM||||Is it hard to install the actuator for keyless entry if I get an alarm.  The shop I went to get some prices wanted $155 to install it, even though the actuators are only $15.  Just wondering if it was easy to do I could save some money.  Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>1987 GT (Maroon)*5 Speed*<BR>(Canadian Car)<BR>2.8L Mods--No Cat, K&N||||reg||1
