Z||000002||Jake_Dragon||12-20-2001||09:54 PM||||look to the left for a link to the door lock page||||reg||14
Z||000003||Bluemagic||12-21-2001||10:34 AM||||It is not hard after all depending how mechanically inclined you are,You have to pull the door covers off where there is a clear view of inner door, the slider that lock and unlock the door has a wire rod that  is where you connect the actuators with the screw connectors that comes with the kit just put the little square metal block to the slide and tighten the screw.You have  to then drill or screw the actuator brackets to the inner door to provide support. hope it helps.<P>------------------<BR>Keith<BR>85 SE Fiero 4.9L Caddy <BR>345hp||||reg||1
